            "type": "text",
            "text": "Three directions, all about a carat in US 6:\n\n- **A, Low bezel**: the most protective, nothing to catch; the lightest to make.\n- **B, Cushion halo**: looks biggest for the money; more small stones to look after, and the halo sits close to the band's edge.\n- **C, Three-stone**: a smaller oval centre with pear sides; the widest head.\n\nFor hands that work, I'd go with A. Which one, or a mix?"
